[[Twine]] is an item available in the shop for [[Adventurer]]s, at common rarity. The [[Sewing Case]] or [[Twine Badge]] have a chance of restocking with another [[Twine]] after one is purchased, making it easier to get multiple.

The [[Twine]]'s only effect is that it has a chance of giving the character 2 maximum health each time the {{icon/star}} activates, with the chance improved by the number of {{icon/diamond}} [[Neutral]] items. This is mildly useful, but Twine's main purpose is in the crafting of a large number of different [[Adventurer]] items. These crafts are all unique 3-item crafts where the [[Twine]] must be in contact with both other items, with the exception of [[Rope]], which is made of two [[Twine]]s.
